# Deliberately empty of rules, and deliberately present.
#
# npm consults `.gitignore` only when a package declares no ignore file of its own. This project's
# `.gitignore` excludes `dist/`, the build output the installed `ccp` command *is* — so without
# this file, the npm versions that apply that fallback strip the build output from the package and
# install a command pointing at a file that was never shipped (ADR-0009, issue #30).
#
# What ships is decided by `files` in `package.json`, not here. Nothing belongs in this file.
